OL,3,GNEWSANepal flooding victims to get
OL,4,A#50,000 of support
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities in Nepal impacted by fatal
OL,7,Fflash flooding will receive #50,000
OL,8,Fworth of support funded by officials in
OL,9,FGuernsey.
OL,11,FThe island's government said its
OL,12,FOverseas Aid & Development Commission
OL,13,Fhad approved the funding, which will be
OL,14,Fgiven to Cornish-based charity
OL,15,FShelterbox's response team in Nepal.
OL,17,FMore than 1,300 people have been
OL,18,Freported dead in the country following
OL,19,Fflooding which struck near the border
OL,20,Fwith Tibet on 26 August.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
