OL,3,GNEWSANepal flooding victims to get
OL,4,A#50,000 of support
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Jennifer Strachan, the
OL,7,Fcommission's president, said she was
OL,8,Fpleased to support Shelterbox's efforts
OL,9,Fto provide emergency shelter and
OL,10,Fessential household items to affected
OL,11,Fcommunities and families.
